      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.14,
          "end": 2.973,
          "en": "In the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.973,
          "end": 4.74,
          "en": "what we want to do here is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.74,
          "end": 7.32,
          "en": "we want to wrap this list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.32,
          "end": 8.84,
          "en": "with transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.84,
          "end": 11.13,
          "en": "because we wanna animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.13,
          "end": 15.26,
          "en": "the addition and removal of list items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.26,
          "end": 16.8,
          "en": "but it will have a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.8,
          "end": 18.64,
          "en": "It's not just one list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.64,
          "end": 20.07,
          "en": "because of before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.07,
          "end": 23.08,
          "en": "we'll have multiple list items here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.08,
          "end": 25.1,
          "en": "And therefore, transition won't work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.1,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "because transition is steered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 28.313,
          "en": "to work with one element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 29.72,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "But Vue has got us covered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 35.22,
          "en": "It has the transition group component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.22,
          "end": 37.49,
          "en": "In addition to transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.49,
          "end": 39.14,
          "en": "transition group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 39.14,
          "end": 40.62,
          "en": "as the name suggests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 40.62,
          "end": 43.45,
          "en": "is there to work with multiple elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 43.45,
          "end": 46.83,
          "en": "and it can also animate multiple elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 46.83,
          "end": 48.41,
          "en": "at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 48.41,
          "end": 50.19,
          "en": "So it's great for lists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 51.04,
          "end": 52.17,
          "en": "where in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 52.17,
          "end": 55.49,
          "en": "we only add or remove one user at the same time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 55.49,
          "end": 57.2,
          "en": "but of course you could have other lists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 57.2,
          "end": 58.49,
          "en": "where multiple items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 58.49,
          "end": 60.83,
          "en": "are added or removed at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 60.83,
          "end": 63.81,
          "en": "And that is why transition group is great for lists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 63.81,
          "end": 67.28,
          "en": "It is capable of animating individual lists items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 67.28,
          "end": 70.253,
          "en": "but also multiple items at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 72.52,
          "end": 74.22,
          "en": "There's one important thing you gotta know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 74.22,
          "end": 76.27,
          "en": "about transition group, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 76.27,
          "end": 80.18,
          "en": "Transition to components used before in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 80.18,
          "end": 83.28999999999999,
          "en": "renders no element to the Dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 83.28999999999999,
          "end": 85.22,
          "en": "It's just here in the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 85.22,
          "end": 87.47,
          "en": "to give Vue some instructions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 87.47,
          "end": 90.81,
          "en": "but you don't see it in the actual Dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 90.81,
          "end": 93.25,
          "en": "If we inspect show users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 93.25,
          "end": 95.05,
          "en": "which is the button we're animating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 95.05,
          "end": 97.923,
          "en": "there is no transition component here in the Dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 98.96000000000001,
          "end": 101.36,
          "en": "Now that will be different for this list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 101.36,
          "end": 103.25999999999999,
          "en": "and transition group, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 103.25999999999999,
          "end": 106.28,
          "en": "Transition group will render",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 106.28,
          "end": 108.66,
          "en": "an element to the Dom in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 108.66,
          "end": 110.77000000000001,
          "en": "and you can control which element it is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 110.77000000000001,
          "end": 113.28,
          "en": "by giving it detect prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 113.28,
          "end": 116.35,
          "en": "And here we want to unordered list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 116.35,
          "end": 118.95,
          "en": "So we, in the end replace our wrapper here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 118.95,
          "end": 120.77,
          "en": "the unordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 120.77,
          "end": 122.84,
          "en": "with transition group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 122.84,
          "end": 125.08,
          "en": "giving it a tag off UL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 125.08,
          "end": 128.453,
          "en": "and you can use any valid HTML element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 129.69,
          "end": 132.313,
          "en": "You can also use a custom component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 133.37,
          "end": 134.31,
          "en": "Now besides that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 134.31,
          "end": 136.86,
          "en": "it works pretty much like transition, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 136.86,
          "end": 140.03,
          "en": "It also adds those CSS classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 140.03,
          "end": 141.62,
          "en": "to the elements which are added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 141.62,
          "end": 142.63,
          "en": "or removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 142.63,
          "end": 145.97,
          "en": "It dives into the CSS code to see how long",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 145.97,
          "end": 147.15,
          "en": "an animation takes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
